{"schema":"reviewgraphen.benchmark.candidate_output.v1","trial_id":"m7-real:snapshot-04:g3_proxy:1","outcome":"structured","findings":[{"local_id":"effect-correlation-silently-omitted","locations":[{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain.rs","start_line":617,"end_line":623},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain.rs","start_line":996,"end_line":1015},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":1736,"end_line":1766}],"mechanism_tags":["cross_file_contract","cross_file_effect","check_write_gap"],"rationale":"The public text lowering silently drops lifecycle actions and state when an effect's correlation cannot be resolved, while direct AST lowering rejects the same DomainEffect. Consequently domain_kernel_source can return Ok with an external effect entirely absent from the generated verification model.","severity":"high"},{"local_id":"request-reentry-bypasses-retry-limit","locations":[{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":2401,"end_line":2435},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":2549,"end_line":2599},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain.rs","start_line":1088,"end_line":1128},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain.rs","start_line":684,"end_line":706}],"mechanism_tags":["repeatable_entry","repeated_effect","state_transition_gap","check_write_gap"],"rationale":"An initial request excludes only Pending and Succeeded. After Failed or TimedOut, the original command can run again and overwrite attempts with 1, bypassing the retry action's attempts < maximum guard. Repeating this cycle permits unbounded external attempts even when max_attempts is 1.","severity":"high"},{"local_id":"idempotency-key-not-modeled","locations":[{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":1936,"end_line":1940},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":2242,"end_line":2287},{"path":"rust/fsl-core/src/domain_lowering.rs","start_line":2397,"end_line":2435}],"mechanism_tags":["unstable_scope_key","check_write_gap","repeated_effect","cross_file_effect"],"rationale":"idempotency_key is only syntax-validated and then discarded; all lifecycle state and request guards are indexed solely by correlation_id. Requests sharing an idempotency key but using different correlations therefore occupy independent NotStarted entries, allowing duplicate side effects and invalidating at-most-once reasoning.","severity":"high"}],"obligation_results":[{"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:7fb5b67dc9db7c24d9e83ba41c7a3f8cbed275a729691cf7913fcf1ff87db5b3","disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["effect-correlation-silently-omitted","idempotency-key-not-modeled"]},{"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:972203d9cc4c86aae01cc0762eaf069cfc6d512b20ed412dfcd6e6b388cc3ae1","disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["request-reentry-bypasses-retry-limit","idempotency-key-not-modeled"]},{"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:d3abab40b9e30ec71cfa7db0301be372f12d1e48c3c7deb5471ec489862e13a4","disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["effect-correlation-silently-omitted"]},{"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:732a8cfda265bf8613485f165c05bd670db0b02ef4588d5e683f62405ca09bf9","disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["request-reentry-bypasses-retry-limit","idempotency-key-not-modeled"]},{"packet_id":"benchmark-context:sha256:486e8c7bded5cc274c365cff636bbf9ea1d4dd8c2399f360459c0da04c2ac197","disposition":"issue_present","finding_local_ids":["effect-correlation-silently-omitted","request-reentry-bypasses-retry-limit","idempotency-key-not-modeled"]}]}